    "needs_review": [
      "cloud_name is a vault credential field that rides in the host path, so base_url uses the canonical v1.1 { template } form and every tool path is relative to /v1_1/{cloud_name}. The shape-proof rendered it with Cloudinary's public demo cloud",
      "list_resources returns image assets of the default 'upload' delivery type. Video and raw resource types, and prefix/tag filtering, need the /resources/{resource_type}/{type} subpath and are not wired here",
      "Cloudinary documents a max_results cap of 500; both list tools clamp to 50 so a single tool result stays inside the 2000-character truncate",
      "list_folders' max_results and next_cursor parameters are taken from the Admin API docs. Every path answers 401 with a dummy key, so parameter acceptance is documentary, not blind-verified",
